  "track.runtime.m.keys.title": "A list with and without key()",
  "track.runtime.m.keys.overview": "A list A, B, C; each item has a `remember` and a `LaunchedEffect(movie.id)`. Pick an operation, toggle `key()` and look at each position.",
  "track.runtime.m.keys.wrapup": "Without a key, instances are identified by position: depending on the operation, some items are kept and some recompose with the state of the old position. With a key, instances follow the key. The outcome differs per scenario.",
